{"data":[{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:13:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107413935599358424"],"id":"2107413935599358424","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4427,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":4},"text":"免费帮打屁股针，就是针管有点长（18cm）","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107413935599358424"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:10:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107413084000436282"],"id":"2107413084000436282","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":42502,"like_count":1142,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":138,"retweet_count":4},"text":"为了研究男人洗澡时用的什么牌子沐浴露 我观察了100名男人并进行了随机采访 其中98名男人的回答都是：“你他妈怎么进来的？”\n……根本没有这个牌子的沐浴露","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107413084000436282"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:37:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107389810671530348"],"id":"2107389810671530348","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2537,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"∴∵☆ ★ ▍▍▍▍▍☆ ★∵∴\n∴☆ ★▅██下雨天还是坐船吧 ██☆ ★∵\n◥███▅█▅█▅█▅███◤\n∵◥███████████◤∵","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107389810671530348"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:37:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107389757420671370"],"id":"2107389757420671370","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":7499,"like_count":145,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":11},"text":"和绳子表白了，她一直吊着我，我脸一直红红的，感觉像是恋爱了，原来幸福真的可以让人喘不过气，心脏也在慢慢放松，从小到大的事都在眼前浮现。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107389757420671370"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:37:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107389717088190870"],"id":"2107389717088190870","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":17149,"like_count":313,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":12},"text":"最近双腿中间长了一个大包，有点像意大利炮，随着年龄的增长，它好像越来越大了，现在已经对我的生活造成影响了。每天早上起来被子都莫名其妙的出现在天花板上，现在已经感冒好多天了。去五金店老板非说我偷他钢筋。晚上去树林里面上厕所，听到有人大喊有大象有大象就追看我打。说出来你可能不信，但这","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107389717088190870"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T06:33:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107358514318647559"],"id":"2107358514318647559","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3399,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":1},"text":"跟别人聊天吧，手指啪嗒啪嗒给他们打字吧。跟他们聊你的心事吧，我刚刚看到一块石头，我绑身上去河里一趟。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107358514318647559"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T06:32:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107358409981059500"],"id":"2107358409981059500","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3143,"like_count":33,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":1},"text":"如果有天你想起我，请不要在雨天，雨天太旧了，旧得让人分不清哪滴是雨，哪滴是当年。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107358409981059500"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T06:32:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107358345623634358"],"id":"2107358345623634358","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":7394,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":4},"text":"老实说…不想再抱有这种幻想了 我不知道这算不算是一种情感压抑\n从中学的时候，我就一直渴望能有个温柔的年上大姐姐相伴。\n骨子里我就是不折不扣的姐姐控。格外倾心于成熟稳重、温柔体贴的人，喜欢她自带强大气场，又独独对我心软的模样。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107358345623634358"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T06:32:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107358308713869810"],"id":"2107358308713869810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2820,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"早上起来我会先复制一百条文案清醒一下，中午就会复制一百条文案饭后活动一下，下午再来一个霸气小清新一百条文案，最后晚上再来复制一百条文案，然后再来控一下圈圈，好巴适的一天","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107358308713869810"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T06:30:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107357843284467857"],"id":"2107357843284467857","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2462,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又到了穿聚酯纤维被电的季节","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107357843284467857"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T05:23:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107340886455529609"],"id":"2107340886455529609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":12284,"like_count":125,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":60,"retweet_count":2},"text":"To：这是一封离别信\n想了很久 我其实真的很喜欢你 我在深夜想起你的时候还是会忍不住掉眼泪 消息写了又删 我也在你离开的时候拼命挽回过 这辈子最大的遗憾就是没能和你走到最后 答应过你的好多事都还没有完成 要是能在结婚的年纪遇见你就好了 我觉得这个世界好不公平真心总是被辜负","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107340886455529609"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T04:32:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107328060186091681"],"id":"2107328060186091681","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":34745,"like_count":233,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":200,"retweet_count":8},"text":"看逼算命，不准我吃，谁来？","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107328060186091681"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T03:05:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107306099267309926"],"id":"2107306099267309926","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9959,"like_count":348,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":63,"retweet_count":14},"text":"学校你紫薇吧\n\n我不想上你😇","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107306099267309926"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T02:58:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107304468178260300"],"id":"2107304468178260300","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5359,"like_count":192,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我乃常山赵子龙，简称乃龙 https://t.co/haqCuTHCLO","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107304468178260300"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T02:57:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107304158848299175"],"id":"2107304158848299175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":9074,"like_count":164,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":6},"text":"催催催 都从你老婆身上下来了还催 穿个衣服也催催催催催催","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107304158848299175"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T02:56:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107304081215857073"],"id":"2107304081215857073","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2915,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我是雪容融啊😭💔我和冰墩墩都是冬奥会吉祥物👅为什么你们只喜欢冰墩墩❤️没人喜欢我啊？😭💔🩹","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107304081215857073"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T01:35:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107283561611206814"],"id":"2107283561611206814","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4649,"like_count":86,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"别闹了兄弟 \n我出生时的第一声啼哭就是甜妹音 \n你怎么和我比？","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107283561611206814"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-06T01:34:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107283386662625432"],"id":"2107283386662625432","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":71,"impression_count":93918,"like_count":1113,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":110,"retweet_count":35},"text":"宝宝这次最后操完你屁眼一次我想说的是我要回老家娶媳妇了，其实一直没告诉你我还是更喜欢女的多一点，男的对我而言只是个排解性欲的杯子而已，之前我太穷了找不起女的对象你又不要钱，请你吃个姜母鸭你就上赶着嗦我几把，咱俩也算是两厢情愿谁也不欠谁","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107283386662625432"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T18:03:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107169767409017291"],"id":"2107169767409017291","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4676,"like_count":72,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":0},"text":"以前你总推开我 现在我300斤了 你再推个试试","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107169767409017291"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T12:30:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107086033557016868"],"id":"2107086033557016868","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8686,"like_count":205,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":5},"text":"苹果18出的时候，那么苹果17势必会降价，此时苹果16必将迎来大跳水，那么苹果15的价格来到了冰点，苹果14必将白菜价，还有苹果13也来到谷底，苹果11也会跟着降，那么苹果8性价比无敌辣，此时正是我入手苹果4s的最佳时机","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107086033557016868"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T12:29:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107085776798564387"],"id":"2107085776798564387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":7889,"like_count":194,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":3},"text":"本人有幸喝过一次星巴克\n当时一对情侣吵架女生把手里的摔了我正好路过溅到我嘴里一滴至今回味无穷","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107085776798564387"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T11:57:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107077736531624212"],"id":"2107077736531624212","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5376,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2107048357663515080","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这我是真喜欢。。 https://t.co/GwLRoMa0GB","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107077736531624212"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T11:15:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107067069439324260"],"id":"2107067069439324260","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3346,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"因为原神牛逼呀[捂脸]我真觉得阅历丰富成熟一点的人都会喜欢原神的[泪奔]成年人的世界太复杂 每次我没有生活的动力时就会玩一会原神 作为一个在社会上摸爬滚打的人 真的是要多看看原神的视频或者日常直播 真的太治愈了 一股温暖的力量流入我心房 不喜欢原神的应该是小孩子不知道社会黑暗","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2107067069439324260"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-05T10:27:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107054950899658818"],"id":"2107054950899658818","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3729,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我蛋逍遥·神从此